Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:05.54,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3620,4660)\pos(643.373,408.996)}Episode 62\N\N\N\N\NRallying Against Wú
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your Majesty has just acscended to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you oppose Wei, you should lead the army in person and uphold justice for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:36.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.6,478.4)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But if you are to attack Wu, then you\N only need to assign a capable general.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:40.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(324.67,476.317)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why bear the burden yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.57,0:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Elder Brother!\N-Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're the Emperor, you've\N forgotten the Oath of the Peach Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you avenging Second Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.94,0:01:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.86,0:01:21.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(264.594,487.698)}Qín Mì\NStyled: Zǐchì
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, the officials are against it. \NWe must not act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who won't let us take revenge? Who's stopping us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What would they know about \Nthe oath we made so long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you refuse to send troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I shall avenge him with my own life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If we cannot take revenge,\N I would rather die without seeing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, I shall go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}You can lead your retinue from Langzhong
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}and I will lead elite troops to meet you at Jiangzhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}We will then attack Eastern Wu and take revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I know well that you whip the soldiers after drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Such is the path to disaster, yet you keep those men.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Be lenient from now on. Do not act as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I will keep this in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}You are risking your life to pursue some petty justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}This is not what the wise ancients did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I hope you will reconsider this rash expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.85,0:03:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Failure is certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}We wish to launch an expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}yet you dare utter such demoralizing words!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I die without any regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I only weep for our new foundation,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}for it is doomed before it has even begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Qin Mi spoke out of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Despite his insolent tone, I beg for your clemency.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jail him for now. He will be dealt with after we return.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In three days, you two are to obtain white clothes and white armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The entire army will attack Wu in \Nmourning clothes to take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days! Any delays and \Nyou'll be punished by military law!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:14.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(282.279,461.887)}Zhāng Dá
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:14.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1020.497,467.321)}Fàn Qiáng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:21.08,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Sacred vessels refers to The Nine {\i1}Dǐng{\i0} (鼎); symbols of royal authority during the Zhou Dynasty and later became synonymous with imperial authority during the later dynasties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The one who usurped the\N Sacred Vessels of Han was Cao Cao;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}the man who ended the sacrifices to your dynasty was not Sun Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}If the Wei traitors were eradicated, Wu would naturally submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I hope that you will accept Qin Mi's precious words
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.55,0:04:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}and strengthen the army to pursue a superior plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}This way, the spirits of the nation will be fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Your official Zhuge Liang so petitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}My mind is set. I shall not hear any more objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Hear my edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:05:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Chancellor Zhuge Liang will defend the two Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\}The General Mighty as a Tiger, Zhao Yun, will handle supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}and Huang Zhong will lead the vanguard with 750,000 troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The Bingyin day of the 7th month of the\N 1st year is a lucky day to start the expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Thus we declare!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:26.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}If Fa Xiaozhi still lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}he would have been able to prevent this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How are the white flags and white armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,General, we searched across the land, but white cloth has been scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They might not be ready within three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please allot a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You will find white cloth, whether they be underground or in heaven! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:06:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, even if white cloth was bountiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,they could not be readied in one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm desperate for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I could go to Jiangdong and\N get those bastards immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We dare not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Drag them out!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You will have white flags and\N white armor ready by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you dare miss the deadline, I will kill you and make an example out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the wine of death from Zhang Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let us drink and\N let drunkenness relieve our sorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than let him kill us, I'll kill him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we make white clothes and \Nwhite armor with wounds on our body?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you want to wait for him to chop our heads off tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we approach him in order to take action?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are fated to die, he wouldn't be drunk tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are not fated to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,he would be on his bed, drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, my heart has been \Nthumping hard and I cannot rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,General, this is because you miss General Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:37.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,160)}"Spirit Tablet of the Han Marquis of Hanshou, Guan Yu"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,General, get some rest, get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.11,0:10:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang! We have an important matter to report...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We greet Your Highness, the Marquis of Wu. \NWe are here to offer Zhang Fei's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Reward the surrendering officers Fan Qiang and Zhang Da well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:29.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4540,4940)\pos(960,454.4)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Bao, my virtuous nephew, why are you so sorrowful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:46.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3860,4180)\pos(1012.8,486.4)}Zhāng Bāo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Fan Qiang and\N Zhang Da murdered my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,cut his head off, and left for Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Third Brother! Third Brother!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, how can you mutilate your sacred body before seeking revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}When I was but a common men,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I swore to be brothers with Guan Yu\N and Zhang Fei, living and dying together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Now, I am the Son of Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}but instead of basking in glory with my two younger brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}they both died brutally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Today, after seeing Zhang Bao,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}how can my heart not be torn asunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,160)}"Spirit Tablet of the Marquis of Xixiang, Zhang Fei"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please avenge my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you lead your retinue as the \Nvanguard in avenging your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For the nation and for my father, I am willing to risk my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(299.2,454.4)}Guān Xīng\NStyled: Ānguó
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wu Ban has arrived with troops. I will be the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly a tiger-like son from a warrior's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:14:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please leave\Nthe vanguard's seal with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I received the order. Why are you taking the seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What talent do you even have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have studied fighting since my youth! \NI can use hard bows and long spears!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you dare fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll get my glaive! How difficult is this?\N-I'll get my spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be disrespectful, my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I and your fathers swore to be brothers. We were kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now you two men, sharing fraternal bonds,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.09,0:14:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,should work together to avenge your fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, you quarrel like this, ignoring the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:09.53,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,In the first year of the Zhangwu era, Liu Bei, the Lord of Shu-Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:13.58,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,refusing the constant dissuasion of Zhuge Liang and others,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:20.79,Thinking,,0,0,0,,personally led over seven hundred thousand\N troops against Eastern Wu by land and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:26.16,Thinking,,0,0,0,,His objective was to avenge Guan Yu and Zhang Fei, his sworn younger brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Liu Bei is leading seven hundred and fifty thousand elite troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}This personal expedition of his is through both water and land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Our main force is at Kui Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Liu Bei is garrisoned at the city of Baidi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}and his vanguard has already exited the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}His momentum is great;\N what should be done about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.4,457.6)}Zhūgě Jǐn\NStyled: Zǐyú
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Oh? What good ideas do you offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}You have shown me great favor,\N Your Highness, yet I have no way to repay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I am willing to risk what little is left of my life to see Liu Bei and reason with him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}so our two realms may return to peace and punish Cao Pi together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Eastern Wu murdered my younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}yet you dare come to negotiate with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Your Majesty is the Imperial Uncle \Nof the Han Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Today, you are not thinking about eradicating the Cao who usurped the Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}but, for a relative of another clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}compromising your esteemed dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:18:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}This is forsaking greater justice by pursuing a lesser one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Now Your Majesty is not trying to take the Central Plains, but Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}That is abandoning the important for the petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}The world knows that your ascent
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}heralds the restoration of the realm under you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}But now you pay no heed to Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}wishing to attack Wu instead. \NI believe that this is undesirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}How dare you! Your murder of \None's brothers is an unforgivable sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}We withdraw only after your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Were it not for Chancellor Zhuge,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}your head would be first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Return now and tell Sun Quan something:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}to extend his neck for the executioner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the case, Jiangnan is in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I have a plan that can resolve this crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:06.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3020,3380)\pos(964,469.333)}Cáo Pī\NStyled: Zǐhuán
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.333,480)}Zhào Zī
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}What sort of master is the Marquis of Wu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.95,0:19:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}One of wisdom, benevolence, and ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Surely you are overpraising him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Your Majesty, I am not overpraising him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The Marquis uplifted Lu Su from the lowly gentry; that is his cleverness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}He raised Lü Meng from a line of soldiers; that is his brightness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}He captured Yu Jin but \Nspared him; that is his benevolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}He took Jing Province without shedding a drop of blood; that is his wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}From the Three Rivers, he watches the realm; that is his ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}He now submits to Your Majesty; that is his strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}In these ways, is the Marquis not a master of wisdom, benevolence, and ambition?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Well said!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Does the Marquis study literature?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The Marquis has thousands of ships on the rivers and a million soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}He uses virtuous and able men, \Nand he is ambitious and cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}In his little free time, he reads books
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}and browses historical records, understanding their main ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}He is unlike those scholars who pedantically quote passages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I wish to raise troops and attack Wu. Is this feasible?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}A large nation has troops for an expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}while a small country has strategies for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Does Eastern Wu fear Wei?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}With a million men and the rivers as our moat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}what fear do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Your Majesty, Sun Quan fears the Shu army's momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Therefore, he comes to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}In my opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Wu's struggle with Shu is\N Heaven's will to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}If a great general with thousands of elite troops
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}is sent to cross the river and attack Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}then Wu will fall within ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Once Wu falls, Shu will be isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Your Majesty, why not take this chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:22:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Since Sun Quan has surrendered, \Nhe should be treated with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.99,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Should we attack him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}those who wish to surrender will be discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}It is better to accept him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Your Majesty, accepting his false surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.84,0:22:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}and granting him the title of King
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}is like giving a tiger wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}Not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}We are neither aiding Wu nor Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}When two tigers quarrel, one will be injured. Eliminating them will not be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.37,0:22:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,660)}I want to see Wu and Shu fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord! Liu Bei is leading the entire army of his realm
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.24,0:23:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and barbarian troops under King Shamoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:24:00.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5700,6020)\pos(994.667,530.667)}Gù Yōng\NStyled: Yuántàn
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:24:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The two armies of Han generals \NDu Lu and Liu Ning are, from Dongxi,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,advancing through water and land.\N Their momentum is shaking the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.91,0:24:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The naval force has left Wu gorge and the land force is now at Zigui!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.76,0:24:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Pi is unwilling to send troops in support.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army's momentum is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What can be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-What to do?\N-What should be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.80,0:24:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After Zhou the Youth, there was Lu Su. After Lu Su, there was Lü Meng.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.54,0:24:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Lü Meng has passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.31,0:24:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,no man can share my tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.08,0:24:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, though I am young, I am educated in warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.66,0:24:58.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4420,4780)\pos(977.333,480)}Sūn Huán\NStyled: Shūwǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.39,0:24:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I wish to lead thousands of troops to defeat Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.76,0:25:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Huan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.05,0:25:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What good plans do you have to defeat the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.09,0:25:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have two generals: Li Yi and Xie Jing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.05,0:25:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They both have unstoppable courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.02,0:25:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I only ask for a few thousand \Nelite troops to capture Liu Bei alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.80,0:25:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Virtuous nephew, although you are brave, you are too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You need help from one man before leading troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.72,0:25:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.77,0:25:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to capture Liu Bei with the young general!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.62,0:25:33.87,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2240,2240)\pos(977.333,480)}Pān Zhāng \NStyled: Wénguī
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.40,0:25:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good. I hereby appoint you two Commanders of the Left and Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.70,0:25:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lead the naval and land forces to Yidu to face the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.79,0:25:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not hurt my elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.70,0:26:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei, across over seven hundred {\i1}lǐ{\i0} from Wuxia to Yiling,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.06,0:26:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,sacked more than forty camps! \NHis momentum is great, and hard to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.67,0:26:27.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sun Huan asks for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.35,0:26:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.44,0:26:34.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964.8,475.2)}Huáng Zhōng\NStyled: Hànshēng
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.28,0:26:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This wine is from the Emperor. \NIt is his Majesty who should be thanked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.88,0:26:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We raise a toast to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.82,0:26:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.25,0:26:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us drink together, generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.62,0:26:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.72,0:26:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.42,0:26:57.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3140,3500)\pos(950.667,466.667)}Zhāng Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.37,0:26:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though many of Eastern Wu's generals have passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.57,0:27:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,there are still more than ten capable veterans.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.14,0:27:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty can make Han Dang the main general, Zhou Tai his deputy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.85,0:27:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pan Zhang the vanguard, and\NLing Tong and Gan Ning the reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.68,0:27:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Send them with a hundred thousand troops to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.11,0:27:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.75,0:27:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.14,0:27:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please drink a few more cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.14,0:27:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, heroes are born out of youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.01,0:27:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The generals who followed us in the past are now all old and useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.94,0:27:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, with two such virtuous and gallant nephews, we can certainly destroy Sun Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.58,0:27:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Han Dang and Zhou Tai of Eastern Wu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.06,0:27:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,are leading a hundred thousand troops to break the siege of Yiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.11,0:28:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang is not a rebellious man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.91,0:28:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I misspoke saying old men are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.97,0:28:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be defying his age by facing \Nthe foe and seeking accomplishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.42,0:28:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Bao and Guan Xing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.18,0:28:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.27,0:28:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtuous nephews, spare no effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.61,0:28:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Go assist him now. Withdraw after a small bit of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do not let him get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.34,0:28:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.77,0:28:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall avenge Guan Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.73,0:28:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.80,0:29:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Elder General Huang refused to return and is now surrounded by the Wu army!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.72,0:29:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.33,0:29:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.83,0:29:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.53,0:30:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.04,0:30:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.85,0:30:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your injury is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.83,0:30:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.37,0:31:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but a brute. I am lucky to have met...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.28,0:31:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.77,0:31:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I am seventy-five years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.14,0:31:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough for a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that Your Majesty will preserve Your sacred body
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.32,0:31:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to fight for the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.64,0:31:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.02,0:33:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the Five Tiger Generals, three are now gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.19,0:33:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so much pain for not taking revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.68,0:33:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pass down my edict: \NAll troops, divide into eight sections
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.86,0:33:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and advance by land and water to fight at Xiaoting!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Guan Xing charged into enemy lines \Nto chase Pan Zhang, but has not returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.10,0:34:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Zhang Bao, virtuous nephew.\N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.92,0:34:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hurry there with your troops.\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.54,0:36:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's outside the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.50,0:36:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A lost man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.34,0:36:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I am a general. I am lost and ask for a bowl of rice to satiate my hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.09,0:36:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.54,0:36:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.16,0:36:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.95,0:36:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.34,0:37:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,General, what is this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.47,0:37:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my late father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.60,0:37:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the Young General!\N I am sorry for my disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.16,0:37:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.85,0:37:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Young General, please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.18,0:37:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.75,0:37:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.12,0:37:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, why worship my late father's portrait?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.20,0:38:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When your father was alive, \Nevery family here honored him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We still do, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope your army may avenge him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.92,0:38:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arrival is a blessing to us common folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.34,0:38:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! Open up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.58,0:38:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming, coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.69,0:38:49.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Coming, coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.05,0:38:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here for the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.50,0:38:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.54,0:38:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.20,0:38:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i0}-Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.52,0:39:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.46,0:39:07.59,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(771.2,475.2)}Pān Zhāng \NStyled: Wénguī
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.38,0:39:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, your life is mine!

